---
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
import stats from '../data/stats.json';
import { isTodo } from '../lib/format';

const years = stats.find((s) => s.label === 'Years in business');
const yearsKnown = years && !isTodo(years.value);
---

<section class="team section section--alt">
  <div class="wrap team__inner">
    <div class="team__media">
      <Photo name="kirby-portrait" alt="Kirby Chan" label="Portrait of Kirby Chan" ratio="1 / 1" />
    </div>
    <div class="team__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The team</p>
      <h2>Local is not a slogan. It is the <em>whole</em> method.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Most agents sell across the GTA and learn a neighbourhood on the drive over. We work one
        city, which is why we can tell you what a Berczy semi trades for against a Wismer one and
        why the gap is what it is.
      </p>
      <p>
        {
          yearsKnown ? (
            <>
              {years!.value} years in this business have taught us that the useful part of the job
              is not opening doors. It is knowing which street floods, which school boundary is
              under review and which listing has already been through two failed offers.
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              Years in this business have taught us that the useful part of the job is not opening
              doors. It is knowing which street floods, which school boundary is under review and
              which listing has already been through two failed offers.{' '}
              <span class="todo-badge">TODO: years in business, src/data/stats.json</span>
            </>
          )
        }
      </p>
      <p>
        We say no to listings we cannot price honestly. We tell buyers when a house is wrong for
        them even when it costs us the deal. That is a slower way to build a business and it is the
        only way we know how to work.
      </p>
      <p class="team__todo">
        <span class="todo-badge">TODO: replace this section with Kirby's own words</span>
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/about/">Meet the Team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .team__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--sp-7);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .team__media {
    max-width: 380px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .team__copy > p {
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
  }
  .team__copy .btn {
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
  }
  .team__todo {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 880px) {
    .team__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 0.75fr 1.25fr;
      gap: var(--sp-8);
    }
  }
</style>
